			"Message": "docs(Common): Standardize architecture documentation formatting and emoji alignment\n\nRefine the `Common` crate's `Documentation/GitHub/Architecture.md` by normalizing whitespace and emoji positioning in section headers. Align non-breaking spaces (` `) before emojis across all headings (Overview, Principles, Traits, ActionEffect, etc.) to ensure consistent visual hierarchy and rendering across Markdown viewers.\n\nThis polish enhances readability and maintains the professional presentation of the contract-first design principles defined in the abstract core library.",
