			"Message": "docs(Common): Enhance architecture documentation with visual aids and structured layout\n\nExtend the Common crate's `Documentation/GitHub/Architecture.md` with comprehensive formatting, emoji indicators, and precise markdown structures to improve readability. Refine the visual hierarchy by adding section icons, bullet-point summaries for key concepts like `ActionEffect` composition, and explicit type signatures in code blocks.\n\nUpdate external references to point to raw GitHub URLs with branch resolution to ensure links remain valid in the repository view. Standardize terminology (e.g., wrapping `Rust`, `DTO`, `Tauri` in code ticks) and reorganize tables for better alignment. This creates a polished, self-contained reference that reinforces the contract-first design principles of the abstract core library.",
